<p>A unique identifier for your observation that you can use to reference it with <code>{prf:ref}</code>. Cannot contain spaces or special characters.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><code>class</code> : text</p>
<p>Value of the observation’s class attribute which can be used to add custom CSS or JavaScript.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><code>nonumber</code> : flag (empty)</p>
<p>Turns off observation auto numbering.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Example</strong></p>
<pre><code class="language-{prf:observation}">:label: my-observation

This is a dummy observation directive.
</code></pre>
<p><strong>MyST Syntax</strong></p>
<pre><code class="language-md">```{prf:observation}
:label: my-observation

This is a dummy observation directive.
```
</code></pre>
<h4 id="referencing-observations">Referencing Observations</h4>
